=2 Walkthrough
* You must zone after completing {q:Glittering Gals|Glittering Gals|Glittering Gals} to start this quest.
* Speak with {n:Green Thumb Moogle} for a cutscene, he will ask for {i:Grow-M-Good|Grow-M-Good|4011}.
** Speak with him again for some reminder text that has him musing that "If a way to a man's heart is through his stomach, then the way to a woman's is through flowers!"
** {i:Grow-M-Good|Grow-M-Good|4011} can be purchased on the {z:Auction House} under Other > Misc or from {n:Ceciliotte} for 45,000-50,000 Bayld.
* Trade the {n:Green Thumb Moogle} the {i:Grow-M-Good|Grow-M-Good|4011} for a final cutscene.
* After the cutscene, you'll receive your reward {i:Morbol Mount}.
** Note that you directly receive they key item {k:Morbol companion} instead of the item {i:Morbol Mount}.

=2 Notes
* This quest was added in the {p:July 2016 Version Update|July 2016 Version Update Changes}.

